      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town was named for S.S. Huntley, a pioneer stockman, and the name also honors the Huntley Irrigation Project.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3,
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
